{"title": "Extraplanar Summons", "pageid": 32409, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Extraplanar_Summons", "categories": ["Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Action_Surge.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Action_Surge.webp/300px-Action_Surge.webp, /w/images/f/f4/Action_Surge.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Action_Surge.webp/300px-Action_Surge.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Action_Surge.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Extraplanar Summons</b> is a class action available to githyanki Gate Masters while <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">concentrating</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Rift\" title=\"Astral Rift\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astral Rift\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Rift\" title=\"Astral Rift\">Astral Rift</a>. It summons a githyanki combatant through the astral rift.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nPull an ally into battle through the open <a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Rift\" title=\"Astral Rift\">Astral Rift</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Every other turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Every other turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_LOW_OpenGate_BringReinforcements</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_OpenGate_BringReinforcements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_OpenGate_BringReinforcements\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by spells:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Rift\" title=\"Astral Rift\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astral Rift\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Rift\" title=\"Astral Rift\">Astral Rift</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Gate_Master_Ri%27zel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gate Master Ri'zel\">Gate Master Ri'zel</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Gate_Master_Zyrlak\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gate Master Zyrlak\">Gate Master Zyrlak</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The following 